    "urlText": "Sydney CBD diversions for fun run event",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-51269",
    "content": "<div>\n<div>From 5am to 12pm on Sunday 11 May, route 441 services will start and end their trips at QVB due to road closures on Art Gallery Road for the Mother&rsquo;s Day Classic fun run event in the Domain.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Services towards the Domain will end at QVB, Market St, Stand F (2000140).</div>\n<div>Services towards Birchgrove will start from QVB, York St, Stand B (200042).&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Passengers should allow extra travel time and check signs at bus stops for alternative stop locations. For more information on the event visit the <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/events/2025/05/mothers-day-classic-sydney\">Mother&rsquo;s Day Classic event page</a>.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Missed and alternative stops</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Town Hall Station, Park St, Stand H (2000249)</li>\n<li>Hyde Park, Park St, Stand B (2000157)</li>\n<li>Art Gallery Rd opposite Art Gallery of NSW (2000144)</li>\n<li>Andrew Boy Charlton Pool (200097) &ndash; Alternative stop is QVB, York St, Stand B (200042)</li>\n<li>Art Gallery of NSW (2000111) &ndash; Alternative stop is QVB, York St, Stand B (200042)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
    "subtitle": "Sydney CBD diversions for fun run event",
    "properties": {
      "smsText": "Sydney CBD diversions for fun run event",
      "speechText": "From 5 AM to 12 PM on Sunday 11 May, route 4 4 1 services will start and end their trips at Q V B due to road closures on Art Gallery Road for the Mother’s Day Classic fun run event in the Domain.",
      "announcementType": "serviceChange",
      "publishToAreas": "1",
      "providerCode": "TfNSW"
    },
