    "urlText": "L2 Randwick and L3 Kingsford Lines weeknight full closures due to maintenance",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-51278",
    "content": "<div><strong>Monday 12 to Wednesday 14 May</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Each night from 9pm to 1am</strong>, L2 Randwick and L3 Kingsford Lines light rail services will not run due to planned trackwork and maintenance works.</li>\n<li>During this time, use alternative transport including:\n<ul>\n<li>Replacement bus services or regular bus services between Central Chalmers Street and Randwick or Juniors Kingsford,</li>\n<li>Train services, regular bus services or walking if able to, between Circular Quay and Central Chalmers Street.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div><strong>Replacement bus services:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Replacement bus services will run every 10 to 15 minutes from 9pm to 1am nightly. These times may vary depending on road traffic.</li>\n<li>Replacement buses will not stop at the following locations:\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Surry Hills</strong> (towards Central and Randwick or Juniors Kingsford) - Please use the alternative stop at Central Chalmers Street (approx. 8 minute walk),</li>\n<li><strong>Wansey Road</strong> (towards Central) - Please use the alternative stop at Royal Randwick (approx. 12 minute walk),</li>\n<li><strong>UNSW High Street</strong> (towards Central and Randwick) - Please use the alternative stop at Randwick (approx. 10 minute walk).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Most replacement buses will be accessible; if not, wait for the next service.</li>\n<li>See the <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/news/2025/l2-randwick-line-l3-kingsford-line-weeknight-full-closure-due-to-maintenance\">news story</a> for more detailed service information.</li>\n<li>Allow extra travel time and use <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/trip#/trip\">Trip Planner</a>&nbsp;to see if your travel is affected.</li>\n</ul>",
    "subtitle": "L2 Randwick and L3 Kingsford Lines weeknight full closures due to maintenance",
    "properties": {
      "smsText": "L2 Randwick and L3 Kingsford Lines weeknight full closures due to maintenance",
      "speechText": "Monday 12 to Wednesday 14 May\nEach night from 9PM to 1AM, L2 Randwick and L3 Kingsford Lines light rail services will not run due to planned trackwork and maintenance works.\nDuring this time, use alternative transport including:Replacement bus services or regular bus services between Central Chalmers Street and Randwick or Juniors Kingsford,\nTrain services, regular bus services or walking if able to, between Circular Quay and Central Chalmers Street.\nSee the news story at transportnsw.info for more detailed service information.",
      "announcementType": "serviceChange",
      "publishToAreas": "1",
      "providerCode": "TfNSW"
    },
    "affected": {
