    "urlText": "Parramatta bus diversions for A-League game",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-51541",
    "content": "<div>Road closures will be in place on sections of O&rsquo;Connell St, Ross St and Victoria Rd on Saturday 10 May for an A-League match at CommBank Stadium.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>The following bus stops will be closed and routes 546, 549, 550, 600, 601 and 606 will be diverting while the road closures are in place between approximately 9.30pm to 10pm.&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Walk to nearby alternative stops, see the <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/document/6076/CommBankStadium_EventRoadClosureMap_PLR.pdf\">road closure and transport map</a> for more details:</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Parramatta Leagues Club, O'Connell Street will be closed &ndash; alternative stop O&rsquo;Connell Street opp Harold Street (for services towards the Hills and North West) </li>\n<li>Our Lady of Mercy College, O'Connell Street will be closed &ndash; alternative stop O&rsquo;Connell Street at Fennell Street (for services towards Parramatta Station) </li>\n<li>Victoria Road after Villiers Street will be closed &ndash; alternative stop All Saints Anglican Church, Victoria Road (for services towards Parramatta Station) </li>\n<li>Victoria Road before Marist Place will be closed &ndash; alternative stop O&rsquo;Connell Street opp Harold Street (for services towards the Hills, Epping and Macquarie Park)</li>\n</ul>\n<div>Check signs at stops and see the <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/events/2025/05/league-men-elimination-final-western-sydney-wanderers-v-melbourne-victory\">event page</a> for more info.</div>",
    "subtitle": "Parramatta bus diversions for A-League game",
    "properties": {
      "smsText": "Parramatta bus diversions for A-League game",
      "speechText": "Road closures will be in place on sections of O’Connell St, Ross St and Victoria Rd on Saturday 10 May for an A-League match at CommBank Stadium.",
