    "content": "<div>\n<div>From 5am to midday on Sunday 11 May, route 504 and 506 services will be diverting and using different stops due to road closures for the Mother&rsquo;s Day Classic fun run event in the Domain.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Services will end trips at Riley St opposite Kennedy St Woolloomooloo (201157) and start trips from Riley St at Cathedral St (201159). The stop on St Marys Rd (2000410) will be closed.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Passengers should allow extra travel time and check signs at bus stops for alternative stop locations. For more information on the event visit the <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/events/2025/05/mothers-day-classic-sydney\">Mother&rsquo;s Day Classic event page</a>.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Missed stop</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>St Mary&rsquo;s Cathedral, St Marys Rd (2000410)</li>\n</ul>\n<div><strong>Alternative stop</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Riley St at Cathedral St (201159)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
